"""Level Factory 0.271.0: a stain drawn over its wall, not lit beside it.

`zoo_worldskin.gd` `_stains`: a GLB's `<skin>_stain` meshes (Zoo >= 1.153.0) become one mesh, drawn black and
alpha-blended at `1 - shade` (`STAIN_SHADER`), out of the bake and casting no shadow, so it leaves the wall times the
shade at whatever light the wall has. Two versions retracted and kept in the changelog: opaque in the wall's texture
(an outline, slice 17b) and a multiply overlay (near black at evening, slice 17c).

Proven: tests/unit/test_worldskin_stains.py fails on 0.270.0 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone's suite, exit 0
(suite_clone.out.txt); the slice rebuilt and priced (the factory's docs/findings/slice_look/, slice 17d: draws median
+5, largest +35, one draw a stained building in view).
"""
